    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0508523v1</id>
    <title>Alpha-determinant cyclic modules of $gl_n(C)$</title>
    <updated>2005-08-26T04:56:48Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0508523v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/0508523v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  The alpha-determinant unifies and interpolates the notion of the determinant and permanent. We determine the irreducible decomposition of the cyclic module of $gl_n(C)$ defined by the alpha-determinant. The degeneracy of the irreducible decomposition is determined by the content polynomial of a given partition.</summary>
